+    "body": "The generated workflow adds `queue: max` to write-job concurrency blocks. GitHub Actions concurrency supports only `group` and `cancel-in-progress`, so actionlint v1.7.12 reports:\n\n```text\nunexpected key \"queue\" for \"concurrency\" section. expected one of \"cancel-in-progress\", \"group\"\n```\n\nReproduction:\n\n```bash\nactionlint .github/workflows/*.yml\n```\n\nPlease remove `queue: max` from all job concurrency sections and update tests/docs that require it. `cancel-in-progress: false` already preserves the running write; GitHub manages at most one pending run per concurrency group.",
