+    "body": "Fixes #85.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Require whitespace or end-of-input after the requested version in `extractReleaseNotes()` so `1.2` no longer matches a `1.2.3` changelog header.\n- Add a regression test that extracts `1.2` from a changelog containing both `1.2.3` and `1.2` sections.\n- Add a patch changeset for the release-note extraction fix.\n- Remove the generated `.gitkeep` placeholder update so the PR diff stays focused on the release-note fix.\n\n## Reproduction / Coverage\n\nBefore the fix, the new regression test failed because `extractReleaseNotes(changelog, '1.2')` matched the `## 1.2.3` header and returned `.3\\n\\n- newer notes`. With the version-token boundary in place, it returns the exact `## 1.2` section: `- older notes`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --test --test-timeout=30000 tests/create-github-release.test.js`\n- `GITHUB_BASE_REF=main node scripts/validate-changeset.mjs`\n- `npm test`\n- `npm run check`\n",
