+    "body": "Fixes #42\n\n## Summary\n\n- Added `scripts/package-info.mjs` to read package name and version from the detected JavaScript package root.\n- Updated publish, release-check, changeset, and release-note scripts to use the derived package name instead of template `PACKAGE_NAME` constants.\n- Added regression tests for scoped package names, npm package specifier formatting, and changeset package matching.\n- Updated README adoption guidance and added `docs/case-studies/issue-42/` with issue/PR data, CI logs, GitHub code-search evidence, online npm references, and JS/Rust template comparison.\n\n## Template Comparison\n\nThe Rust template already derives package identity from `Cargo.toml` through `read_package_info` and has template-default publish skip logic for `example-sum-package-name`, so I did not open a Rust-template issue.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bash scripts/check-mjs-syntax.sh`\n- `npm test`\n- `bun test`\n- `deno test --allow-read`\n- `npm run check`\n- `node scripts/validate-changeset.mjs`\n",
