+    "body": "## Summary\n\nThis PR implements a CI check to prevent manual version modification in `package.json`, as requested in issue #19.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **Added `scripts/check-version.mjs`** - A Node.js script that:\n  - Detects manual version changes in `package.json` during PRs\n  - Compares the PR head against base branch using git diff\n  - Skips check automatically for release PRs (`changeset-release/*`, `changeset-manual-release-*`)\n  - Provides clear error messages with instructions on how to properly request releases\n\n- **Added `scripts/check-changesets.mjs`** - Converted inline shell script to `.mjs`:\n  - Moved the changeset counting logic from release.yml to a dedicated script\n  - Outputs `has_changesets` and `changeset_count` for GitHub Actions\n\n- **Updated `.github/workflows/release.yml`**:\n  - Added `version-check` job that runs on all PRs\n  - Replaced inline shell script for changeset counting with the new `.mjs` script\n\n### Testing\n\n- All local CI checks (lint, format) pass\n- Scripts tested locally with various scenarios:\n  - Normal PR without version changes: ✅ passes\n  - Release PRs (changeset-release/*): ✅ automatically skipped\n  - Manual release PRs (changeset-manual-release-*): ✅ automatically skipped\n\n### Related Issue\n\nFixes #19\n\n---\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
