+    "body": "## Summary\n\nThis PR implements issue #1 by creating a comprehensive template for AI-driven JavaScript/TypeScript development.\n\n### Features Added\n\n- **Multi-runtime support**: Works with Node.js, Bun, and Deno\n- **Universal testing**: Uses [test-anywhere](https://github.com/link-foundation/test-anywhere) for cross-runtime tests\n- **Automated releases**: Changesets-based versioning with GitHub Actions\n- **Code quality**: ESLint + Prettier with pre-commit hooks via Husky\n- **Package manager agnostic**: Works with npm, yarn, bun, deno, and pnpm\n\n### Files Added\n\n| Category | Files |\n|----------|-------|\n| CI/CD | `.github/workflows/release.yml` |\n| Scripts | `scripts/*.mjs` (12 release automation scripts) |\n| Source | `src/index.js`, `src/index.d.ts` |\n| Tests | `tests/index.test.js` |\n| Examples | `examples/basic-usage.js` |\n| Config | `eslint.config.js`, `.prettierrc`, `deno.json`, `bunfig.toml` |\n| Changesets | `.changeset/config.json`, `.changeset/README.md` |\n| Husky | `.husky/pre-commit` |\n| Docs | `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` |\n\n### Key Design Choices\n\n1. **test-anywhere framework** - Universal testing API that works identically across Node.js, Bun, and Deno\n2. **Changesets workflow** - Professional version management with PR validation and automated releases\n3. **OIDC trusted publishing** - Secure npm publishing without tokens\n4. **9-way test matrix** - CI tests on 3 runtimes × 3 operating systems\n5. **File size limits** - Scripts must stay under 1000 lines for maintainability\n6. **link-foundation libraries** - Scripts use `use-m`, `command-stream`, and `lino-arguments`\n\n### Test plan\n\n- [x] `npm install` completes successfully\n- [x] `npm test` passes all tests\n- [x] `npm run lint` passes with no errors\n- [x] `npm run format:check` passes\n- [x] `npm run check:file-size` passes\n- [ ] CI workflow runs successfully on GitHub Actions\n\n### Issue Reference\n\nFixes #1\n\n---\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
