+    "body": "Take release.yml from https://github.com/link-foundation/test-anywhere, also make sure to copy most of package.json structure (no package-lock.json) as any package manager (npm, bun, yarn, deno and so on) can be used. Make sure we replicate husky for pre-commits checks.\n\nWe should also have default configuration for formatting, eslint and so on.\n\nWe should make sure we support change sets folder with all relevant files for it.\n\nThis is a template repository, so it should contain the skeleton for any AI driven JavaScript/TypeScript project.\n\nAlso https://github.com/link-foundation/test-anywhere itself should be used as testing framework, as it is designed to work with Node, Bun, Deno in the same way.\n\nMake sure to update README.md with detailed description and all design choices.",
