+    "body": "Fixes #91\n\n## Summary\n- branch detect-code-changes merge handling on GITHUB_EVENT_NAME\n- keep pull_request synthetic merge commits on HEAD^2^..HEAD^2\n- use HEAD^1..HEAD for real merge commits pushed to main\n- add git-history regression coverage for both paths\n- add a patch changeset for the CI script bug fix\n\n## Reproduction\nThe new test builds the issue scenario: a feature branch with a source commit followed by a docs-only commit, merged with --no-ff, then runs the detector as a push event.\n\n## Verification\n- node --test --test-timeout=30000 tests/detect-code-changes.test.js\n- GITHUB_BASE_REF=main node scripts/validate-changeset.mjs\n- npm test\n- npm run check\n- bash scripts/check-mjs-syntax.sh\n- bash scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh",
