+    "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes #33 — `setup-npm.mjs` fails on GitHub Actions when Node.js 22.22.2 ships with broken npm 10.9.7 (missing `promise-retry` module).\n\n### Changes\n\n- **Upgrade Node.js 20.x → 24.x** in all workflow files (6 locations in `release.yml`). Node.js 24.x (Active LTS) ships with npm 11.x which doesn't have the `promise-retry` bug.\n- **Add 4-strategy fallback chain** to `setup-npm.mjs`:\n  1. Standard `npm install -g npm@11`\n  2. Curl tarball download (bypasses broken npm entirely)\n  3. npx-based install\n  4. Corepack as last resort\n- **Update GitHub Actions** to latest major versions:\n  - `actions/checkout`: v4 → v6\n  - `actions/setup-node`: v4 → v6\n  - `peter-evans/create-pull-request`: v7 → v8\n- **Fix test command** for Node.js 24 compatibility: `node --test tests/` → `node --test tests/*.test.js` (Node 24 changed how directory arguments are handled)\n- **Exit with error code 1** when all npm upgrade strategies fail (instead of silently continuing)\n- **Case study** with timeline, root cause analysis, and upstream issue references in `docs/case-studies/issue-33/`\n\n### Root Cause\n\nNode.js v22.22.2 ships npm 10.9.7 with an incomplete dependency tree — the `promise-retry` module (required by `@npmcli/arborist`) is missing. Any `npm install -g` command triggers arborist and crashes with `MODULE_NOT_FOUND`.\n\n### Upstream Issues\n\n- [actions/runner-images#13883](https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/13883)\n- [nodejs/node#62430](https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/62430)\n- [npm/cli#9151](https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9151)\n\n### Reference\n\n- [link-assistant/web-capture#55](https://github.com/link-assistant/web-capture/pull/55) — Reference implementation with curl fallback\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `node --check scripts/setup-npm.mjs` passes (syntax valid)\n- [x] `npx eslint scripts/setup-npm.mjs` passes (no lint errors)\n- [x] `npm test` passes (6/6 tests)\n- [x] Pre-commit hooks pass (prettier + eslint)\n- [x] CI pipeline passes with Node.js 24.x (all 9 test matrix jobs: 3 runtimes × 3 OSes)\n- [x] Lint and format checks pass\n- [x] Changeset check passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
