+    "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes #3 - The release formatting script now correctly handles all changeset types (Major, Minor, Patch) instead of only Patch changes.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe `scripts/format-release-notes.mjs` script only handled `### Patch Changes` sections, causing it to fail on Minor and Major releases:\n- ❌ Section headers remained in release notes\n- ❌ PR detection was skipped\n- ❌ Release formatting failed silently\n\n**Example:** Release v0.1.0 showed:\n```markdown\n### Minor Changes\n\n- 65d76dc: Initial template setup...\n```\n\n## Solution\n\nUpdated the regex pattern to match all changeset types:\n- Replace hardcoded \"Patch Changes\" with flexible `(Major|Minor|Patch) Changes` pattern\n- Extract commit hash from both inline and embedded formats\n- Add informative logging for debugging\n\n**After fix**, releases will show clean formatting:\n```markdown\nInitial template setup...\n\n**Related Pull Request:** #X\n\n---\n\n[![npm version](https://img.shields.io/badge/npm-0.1.0-blue.svg)](...)\n```\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Core Changes\n- **scripts/format-release-notes.mjs** (lines 92-122):\n  - New flexible regex pattern matching all changeset types\n  - Handles optional commit hash formats\n  - Improved error messages\n\n### Testing\nCreated comprehensive test suite in `experiments/`:\n- ✅ `test-format-major-changes.mjs` - Tests Major changes\n- ✅ `test-format-minor-changes.mjs` - Tests Minor changes\n- ✅ `test-format-patch-changes.mjs` - Tests Patch changes\n- ✅ `test-format-no-hash.mjs` - Tests without commit hash\n\nAll tests passing ✅\n\n### Documentation\n- **docs/case-studies/issue-3/README.md** - Comprehensive case study:\n  - Timeline of events\n  - Root cause analysis\n  - Impact assessment\n  - Solution design\n\n## Related Work\n\n**Issues created in affected repositories:**\n- link-foundation/gh-download-pull-request#5\n- link-foundation/gh-download-issue#5\n- link-foundation/test-anywhere (creation attempted)\n\n**Reference implementation:**\n- link-assistant/agent#59 (original fix)\n- link-assistant/agent#58 (original issue)\n\n## Testing\n\n✅ Local CI checks passing:\n- ESLint\n- Prettier\n- File size checks\n\n✅ GitHub Actions CI passing\n✅ All unit tests passing\n\n## Verification\n\nTo verify the fix works:\n1. Run test scripts: `npm test`\n2. Check Major changes: `node experiments/test-format-major-changes.mjs`\n3. Check Minor changes: `node experiments/test-format-minor-changes.mjs`\n4. Check Patch changes: `node experiments/test-format-patch-changes.mjs`\n\n## Impact\n\n- **Low risk** - Backward compatible with existing Patch changes\n- **High value** - Enables proper formatting for all release types\n- **Well tested** - Comprehensive test coverage\n- **Documented** - Full case study in docs/\n\n---\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
